        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GEOPRTCOM, Georgetown Entryset with Portofino Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTraditionally styled the Single Cylinder Portofino Leverset With Georgetown Rose made by Grandeur features an elegant design. The slightly curved Portofino Lever grants the Grandeur Georgetown Entryset with Portofino Lever an air of romance with subtle victorian detail. This door lever style is a classic for a reason. The simplistic appearance means that it is great for almost any style home from the most modern apartment to a century-old period home and every decor in between. The wave lever is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and the matching Georgetown Deadbolt gives this entry set a clean design suitable for a wide array of decor applications from traditional to historic to contemporary. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Georgetown Single Cylinder Entry Set Combo With Portofino Lever fits doors 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. It is easy to install and comes backed by a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-georgetown-series\"><b>Georgetown Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GEOPRTCOM Single Cylinder Portofino Leverset With Georgetown Rose:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur Georgetown Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Length: 4.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Projection: 2.22\"</li>\r\n<li>Georgetown Rosette Diameter: 2.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt  Projection: 0.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PRT-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Portofino Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GEO-rose.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Georgetown Rosette Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GEO-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Georgetown Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Portofino Entryset With Georgetown Rose, Grandeur GEOPRTCOM",
                "description": "Traditionally styled the Single Cylinder Portofino Leverset With Georgetown Rose made by Grandeur features an elegant design. The slightly curved Portofino Lever grants the Grandeur Georgetown Locking Door Leverset an air of romance with subtle victorian detail. This door lever style is a classic for a reason. The simplistic appearance means that it is great for almost any style home from the most modern apartment to a century-old period home and every decor in between. The wave lever is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and the matching Georgetown Deadbolt gives this entry set a clean design suitable for a wide array of decor applications from traditional to historic to contemporary. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Georgetown Single Cylinder Entry Set Combo With Portofino Lever fits doors 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. It is easy to install and comes backed by a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty.",
                "keywords": "GRA-GEOPRTCOM, Grandeur GEOPRTCOM, Grandeur GEOPRT, Georgetown lever Entry Sets, Georgetown combo packs, single cylinder entrysets, Georgetown Portofino Lever Entry Sets, Georgetown Single Cylinder Entry Set Combo With Portofino Levers, Portofino Lever with Georgetown Roses, traditional levers, classic levers, wave levers, Georgetown Entryset with Portofino Levers"
